Breaks: base-files (<< 2)
Description: directory service daemon and dscl
 opendirectoryd keeps the local users and groups in
 /var/db/dslocal/nodes/Default and serves them to the Open Directory
 framework, to the user and group lookups of the C library and to the
 membership calls. It checks and changes passwords, which it keeps as
 salted PBKDF2-SHA512 hashes.
 .
 dscl reads and edits the records.
